message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ColdSeepSim: One-dimensional numerical model for formation and long-term evolution of focused-fluid escape systems in marine environments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: You
    given-names: Kehua
    affiliation: "University of Texas at Austin"
    email: "kehua@ig.utexas.edu"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-05"
abstract: "ColdSeepSim is a one-dimensional MATLAB-based numerical model for simulating the formation and long-term evolution of focused fluid escape systems in marine environments. The model couples hydraulic fracturing, multiphase flow, and multicomponent reactive transport, including methane hydrate formation."
keywords:
  - cold seep
  - methane hydrate
  - multiphase flow
  - hydraulic fracturing
  - reactive transport
  - marine geosystems
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KehuaYou/ColdSeepSim"
